# Festag Night — dark mode tokens

Canonical source: `lib/design-tokens/dark.ts` → `app/globals.css` `[data-theme="dark"]`.

Cool graphite–slate surfaces. Accent `#5B647D` for focus/links only. CTA fills are soft cool-white — never colored.

## Ladder

| Layer | Token | Value |
|---|---|---|
| Canvas | `--festag-black-canvas` | `#0B0C10` |
| Content | `--festag-black-content` | `#111318` |
| Raised | `--festag-black-raised` | `#171A21` |
| Popup | `--festag-black-popup` | `#1C2028` |
| Peak | `--festag-black-peak` | `#222631` |
| Hover | `--hover` | `#262A35` |
| Ink | `--festag-night-ink` | `#E8EAF0` |
| Primary accent | `--festag-primary` | `#5B647D` |
| Ready CTA | `--festag-btn-dark-bg` | `#F0F2F5` / fg `#1A1A1E` |

## Rules

1. Dark primary CTAs = soft cool-white `#F0F2F5` + dark ink — never green/slate fills.
2. Secondary/Google/Apple in dark = quiet transparent + hairline.
3. Soft cool ink — not pure white body text.
4. Full pills `999px`.
5. Semantic green only for success / ok badges.
6. Input focus stroke `#5B647D` — no glow.

## Do not

- Colored CTA fills in dark (green, slate, neon blue)
- Forest green canvases
- Pure `#000` canvas or pure `#FFFFFF` body text
